out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards already refuse once and must be left alone** — **which is harder than it sounds, because a one-line refusal invites everybody in the room to improve it.** ⚠ **Rows 5 are the pair the cycle turns on**: one has five reasons, the fifth about the applicant, **and one has two unremovable reasons where the choice is the one the reader can act on.** **Ask the room, after row 5, which of the two choices was the harder, and why it was the second.**'));
