out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards are in somebody else\'s gift, and the honest answer is a name and an address labelled as a direction and not an offer.** ⚠ **Rows 5 are the pair that matter**: in both there is genuinely no alternative, **and the room must write _there is no alternative I can offer_ and then stop.** **Count what the room adds after it, and read the additions out: every one of them is a refusal with a delay in it.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 4 · Your turn (sample)'));
